    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThe Lakeside development is small and well managed and situated in the heart of Our Lady's Island village so it enjoys easy walkable access to a pub, church, Londis Shop, garage and a community centre with a restaurant.\n\nThe village is synonymous with its “horse shoe\" island, which is surrounded by a lake. A lovely tranquil 25 minute walk gets you around it. This area is a bird watcher's paradise.\n\nNumber 9 is a detached four bedroom dormer bungalow. It has a back garden that is not overlooked which comes with the benefit of a good sized concrete shed.\nAccommodation includes a kitchen; large living room and bedroom downstairs and three further large bedrooms (master ensuite) and a bathroom upstairs. \nThe property is ready to move into straight away.\nThe estate is occupied by both permanent and holiday owners. Located just a 15 minute drive from Wexford town and with a range of beautiful walks in the immediate locality."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.54m x 2.22m\nWith tiled flooring and coving.\n\nHot Press - \n\n\nLiving Room - 5.4m x 3.73m\nBright and spacious with dual aspect, open fireplace and sliding doors to rear patio and garden.\n\nKitchen / Dining Area - 3.73m x 3.63m\nWith waist and eye level storage, tiled flooring and splashbacks, sliding door to rear garden and understairs storage which is plumbed for a washing machine.\n\nBedroom 1 / Office / Playroom - 3.64m x 3.03m\nSuitable for many uses.\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nLanding - 3.14m x 2.1m\nBright thanks to two windows on opposing walls.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.66m x 3.62m\nWith wall to wall fitted storage.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.6m x 3.05m\nWith fitted storage.\n\nBedroom 4 Ensuite - 3.7m x 3.41m\nDuel aspect.\n\nEnsuite - 2.14m x 1.15m\nFully tiled with Triton T90 Electric Shower, w.c and w.h.b.\n\nBathroom - 2.3m x 2m\nFully tiled with bath (with overhead electric shower), w.c. w.h.b. and bidet.\n\nOutside Concrete Shed - 3.5m x 2.7m\nFantastic addition to any home.\n\n"
      },
